  "description": "After centuries of war, the Avian and Serpent races agree to a tentative peace and joint training of cadets. Instructor Sahwahyun, an admired Avian war hero, maintains a strict composure that keeps all students at bay—except Yahyul, an unassuming Serpent cadet harboring hidden depths beneath his stoic shell. As their paths intertwine through subtle encounters, a halting bond forms that soon blossoms beyond mere camaraderie into something deeper that defies the boundaries between their races. \n\n(Source: Tapas)",
